    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Primary Path: /wiki-ingest",
      "items": [
        "User → Skill dispatches wiki-ingest Agent (Sonnet) via Task tool",
        "Agent reads raw doc, authors IngestPlan JSON, calls enchiridion discover (FTS5 dedup)",
        "Agent calls enchiridion ingest --plan; CLI: validate → resolve → execute → write wiki/*.md",
        "isomorphic-git commits to Vault repo; CLI prints commit SHA; Agent reports manifest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "/wiki-ask Path",
      "items": [
        "User → /wiki-ask → Skill dispatches wiki-researcher Agent (Haiku) via Task tool",
        "Agent calls enchiridion search; CLI queries FTS5 (Search Index lazily syncs HEAD commits)",
        "Agent follows typed edges (refines / contradicts / example-of) to expand the answer frontier",
        "Agent synthesises answer; proposes save-candidate — never writes directly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Architecture Notes",
      "items": [
        "Data Layer (CLI, Vault, Index, Git): purely deterministic — no LLM calls; LLM zone holds Host + Skills + Agents",
        "enchiridion CLI: 15+ subcommands via node scripts/cli.cjs shim (discover, ingest, search, vault, page, place, hook, save-session…)",
        "External: Claude API (host-only, Sonnet/Haiku) · isomorphic-git (pure-JS) · node-sqlite3-wasm (FTS5 WASM) · Node.js ≥ 22.12"
      ]
    }
